                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once per activation, before making an Activation Test, this Character may lose up to 2 Vitality to remove an equal amount of STRESS. This cannot reduce the character below 1 VITALITY. If this reduces their STRESS to 0, they automatically pass the Activation Test.</characteristic>
