                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Small Weapon: This character may make a free Ranged Attack before making a Sprint or Charge.
Stealth Attack: This weapon adds +2 Velocity when the target of the attack considers this character obscured by darkness.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
