                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Point-Blank: + [MORTAL] [MORTAL] Potency when firing at a target within 4”.
Poorly Maintained: If you roll a 1 while firing, this gun jams and cannot be fired again until you spend a simple interact action to clear the jam.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
