                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Sniper: Enemy Targets get no COVER bonus from attacks with this weapon. Cannot target anything within 4” of the firing character.
Static: Cannot be used if the shooter has moved this turn.</characteristic>
