          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Royal only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">All BLOODHOUNDS in this crew may deploy up to 12” outside of deployment zones, so long as they are more than 8” from enemy models and outside enemy deployment zones. When deploying in scenarios with random deployment, BLOODHOUNDS may re-roll their deployment dice and take either the first or second result.</characteristic>
